  "summary": "The experiment tested a foundational multimodal approach combining RNA (PCA-n2000) and image (ResNet50) data with simple concatenation fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.5266 and F1 of 0.5104 suggest moderate performance, but no direct comparison to single-modality baselines is available. The effectiveness of modality combination remains uncertain due to lack of controlled baseline experiments."
}

